**This list is EXHAUSTIVE. The renderer has no image for any modifier not listed here.** Anything else (e.g. `.new`, `.old`, `.sad`, `.funny`, `.adventure`, `.scary`, `.american`) renders as a meaningless dot. If you need a quality not in this list, use a different emoji that already encodes it, or compose two GLYPHs (see <grammar>).
